    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it expands the \"discourse\" but doesn't it feel like we're losing something fundamental though? like if the skill and the beauty aren't there anymore, aren't we basically just looking at propaganda or activism instead of actual art? it feels like the \"value\" you're talking about is just becoming purely ideological.",
